        "limitations": "Positive finite construction and comparison of stated upper bounds, not optimal tensor rank or a runtime guarantee. The n>=7 threshold is required for this cost comparison. Does not improve omega below 9/4; no polynomial-source restriction, historical priority, independent mathematical review or formalization is claimed. Exact seeded evaluations are controls, not the uniform proof.",
