        "statement": "For every conflict-free balanced family on 3N coordinates with N<=7, and every real n>0, each displayed budget B(n)=(n+1)^(3N)+sum_{k>=1}c_k*(n+1)^(3N-k), c_k>=0, satisfies B(n)>p*n^(9N/4). Distinct coordinate parts give p<=binom(3N,N); weighted AM-GM and exact integer comparisons prove the gap. The N=8 row is a non-exclusion control, so N>=8 is necessary only for this displayed budget to pass the direct 9/4 gate.",
